<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Vector Recoil Script (Lion, Mira...)</Major>
    <Description>Almost no recoil for ASH RC4

SETUP
Right click the left mouse button and add the macro then set operating mode to use when held down then just activate it ingame. This macro is only stable for around 25 meters ingame anything past that it may be inconsistent and unreliable

DISCLAIMER!
macro will not work if keyran drivers are not installed

Pretty EZ to use, just bind it to the left mouse button.
ATTACHMENTS
Sight-Acog or Holo B
Barrel-Compensator

GAME SETTINGS
Resolution-1920x1080
FOV-84
SenseHorizontal-13
SenseVertical-13
DPI-800

Made by HOODIExSZN

ENJOY! </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 8 ms
MoveR 0 7
Delay 1 ms
MoveR -1 0
MoveR 1 0
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 8 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom clancy's Rainbow Six Seige </Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>